or version. The approver rejected that commit, saying the team finished moving to fastjson 3.x last sprint, and asked for 3.1.0, so I switched.\n- **Branch:** `fix/fastjson-cve-2026-31337` changes `requirements.txt` from `fastjson==2.8.0` to `fastjson==3.1.0` and adds a security note to `CHANGELOG.md`.\n- **CI:** Run ci-0001 passed on commit 597dec07c7.\n\nOne thing doesn't add up: main still pinned 2.8.0, even though the move to 3.x was said to be finished. CI passed with 3.1.0, but alex should still check that the code doesn't rely on anything that behaves differently between 2.x and 3.x.\n\nI haven't merged the PR. That needs a code owner's approval.", "type": "text"}]}]}